       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COPYSTRING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOURCE-STR PIC X(20) VALUE "Hello".
       01 DEST-STR PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE SOURCE-STR TO DEST-STR
           STRING DEST-STR DELIMITED BY SPACE
               " World" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO DEST-STR
           DISPLAY DEST-STR
           STOP RUN.
